@PRODUCT_NAME@ @VERSION@ portable build for Windows x64

No installation is required. Run bin\@EXECUTABLE_NAME@.exe to start @PRODUCT_NAME@.

Windows SmartScreen may show "Windows protected your PC" on the first launch.
Choose "More info", then "Run anyway". This build is unsigned; verify the
download with the published .sha256 file.

Settings, the database, and downloaded models live under %LOCALAPPDATA% at the
location shown in Settings. The Microsoft Store build keeps its own separate
data.

The first transcription downloads the recommended model (about 1 GB, one time).

To upgrade, extract the new version's folder and delete the old folder. Your data
is kept. Prefer the Microsoft Store build when available because it is certified
and updates automatically.

Licenses: share\breezedesk\licenses\
Project: https://github.com/victorfu/breeze-desk
